{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape-shift into objects to go unnoticed by your enemies while carrying out stealth missions around the world. Manipulate environmental objects, set traps, and use gadgets like a true spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/7bc6a08bb6c581667cf7945c338745d6.avif?t=1771801150\" width=573 height=126 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.poster.avif?t=1771801150\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.webm?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/edf31bdcaf4ab35c044afa1e1975ae64.mp4?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powerful suit to transform into different objects. Carefully choose the objects you transform into because the suit needs to recharge after use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2ef7b138a4aedec3807ea2cf2450d445.avif?t=1771801150\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.poster.avif?t=1771801150\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.webm?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/272835ad12a1beac813f66af9224153c.mp4?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects have unique utilities that can be used to manipulate the environment. Use a sophisticated hacking system, lure guards with sound-emitting objects, and more. Use these additional abilities to tackle more complex challenges! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fdf871551a31da596ad4b59cceeb67d1.avif?t=1771801150\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.poster.avif?t=1771801150\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.webm?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/fcf5f57a7e9d83d59b1ed861377c2319.mp4?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find advanced gadgets and various items in each scenario. Use them to help Siren in her missions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/2fdb312556e7ccb742bd8f8a988f6f87.avif?t=1771801150\" width=600 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.poster.avif?t=1771801150\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.webm?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/extras/6bce024d6858e917f25c3ebcc3b7504c.mp4?t=1771801150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into various objects and blend into the environment to remain unseen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment with diverse abilities from special objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced gadgets and various items in each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face eccentric and challenging missions while traveling through various countries around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 levels divided into chapters, with unique settings, enemies, and mechanics.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3163560?t=1771801150","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771801150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/99617ad1f12a40307f98a1284f59f53b4145dd05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771801150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3163560/99617ad1f12a40307f98a1284f59f53b4145dd05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771801150","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":